      9: "Ọnwa Ala / Itolu (Oct–Nov): Ofala Festival",
      10: "Ọnwa Okike / Iri (Nov): Creation Myths / Offerings",
      11: "Ọnwa Ajala / Iri na otu (Nov–Dec): Spiritual Cleansing",
